#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:3
#: 12c79fb3f92e433cb961dbb5c8638748
msgid "几何健全性过滤（Geometry Sanity Filter）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:5
#: 034be9d2ad73406687b7826b4868fa31
msgid "**分类：** 筛选与采样"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:7
#: be68bee9fd4d4553af1fb561d4876bf6
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:9
#: b1b4e66f85fa4208baf52e502a4297fd
msgid ""
"`Geometry Filter` 按显式阈值过滤候选结构：最短原子间距、单原子体积、质量密度"
"和有效晶胞。它不计算能量，不修复结构，也不替代 `FPS Filter`。它的职责是在代表"
"性采样和 DFT 前挡掉几何上已经明显不可用的结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:11
#: 29f1a91382834058a4cff3a5d383d058
msgid ""
"空结构和含 NaN/Inf 坐标的结构始终被删除。其他阈值默认关闭，避免用一个通用数值"
"误删含氢分子、slab 或带真空结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:13
#: fb69e6fc6b024b59a9a077e841b1afe6
msgid ""
"短距离检查会把整批结构交给原生邻居扫描一次完成；原生扩展不可用或遇到合法的奇"
"异部分周期晶胞时，自动使用同一距离语义的 Python fallback。这个加速只改变响应"
"时间，不改变阈值和筛选结果。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:15
#: 13f27b57d4934a8991c7d8b8cb0f06db
msgid ""
"卡片中的保留/删除数量预览在后台计算，不会占用界面事件循环。连续调整参数时，中"
"间请求会被合并，界面只采用最新参数对应的结果；正式运行仍会重新按当前参数处理"
"完整输入。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:17
#: 403a7ca50ac243208afdb58573b99f68
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:19
#: f24d2c9cf3b84783815b8f74e101cff6
msgid "对含 $N$ 个原子的有效晶胞，程序计算"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:21
#: 9e9be0e94f454bfc9ece8fb553f4f99b
msgid ""
"\n"
"d_{\\min}=\\min_{i<j}d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}},\\qquad\n"
"v_{\\mathrm{atom}}=\\frac{|\\det\\mathbf C|}{N},\\qquad\n"
"\\rho=1.66053906660\\,\\frac{\\sum_i M_i}{|\\det\\mathbf C|}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:27
#: 09e4b75922444a0397b0474a73380a60
msgid ""
"$d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ 是按周期边界最小镜像得到的距离，单位 Å； "
"$v_{\\mathrm{atom}}$ 的单位是 Å³/atom；原子质量 $M_i$ 用 u，换算后的 $\\rho$ "
"为 g/cm³。所有已开启的上下限必须**同时满足**才保留结构。阈值为 0 表示关闭对"
"应 检查；空结构、非有限坐标，以及被已开启晶胞相关检查命中的无效晶胞会被拒绝。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:32
#: 2d5f310660ea4850ad05c3ef453583ad
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:34
#: fffe4493a9754e4295c3e08f1203edb8
msgid "场景：随机占位和强扰动后出现短键结构"
msgstr "Scenario: Short bonds after random occupation and strong perturbation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:36
#: f94716cbcd9645c7ad3ea8800797461e
msgid ""
"合金候选池经过 `Random Occupancy → Atomic Perturb` 后，少量结构出现 < 1.0 Å "
"的原子重叠。它们进入 DFT 会浪费队列，进入 FPS 会污染 descriptor 空间。"
msgstr ""
"After `Random Occupancy -> Atomic Perturb`, a few alloy candidates contain "
"atom pairs below 1.0 Å. Sending them to DFT wastes jobs, while including "
"them in FPS contaminates descriptor space."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:38
#: a9d67f4b38b14aa38efd1e8e9ceef779
msgid ""
"**输入：** 已生成的候选结构池。 **目标：** 在 FPS 前删除短键和异常体积结构。 "
"**参数设置：** `允许的最短原子对距离`填 `1.2 Å`，`最小单原子体积`填 `5.0 Å³/"
"atom`，`最大单原子体积`填 `40.0 Å³/atom`，密度阈值保持关闭。 **输出：** 只保"
"留满足所有开启阈值的结构。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 导入 `NEP Dataset "
"Display` 后，最短键分布不再有低端离群点；FPS 选出的结构不应再包含明显重叠帧。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:45
#: 5d7118c9f3cc41e2a8b617d2829d86ad
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:46
#: 090df9fc67f440eeaa9c421f75596c80
msgid "允许的最短原子对距离（min_pair_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:48
#: 9905d08e67ea4639be2d8924c99bc75f
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0 Å（关闭）。任意原子对允许的最近距离，是与元素种类无关的硬门"
"槛。周期方向使用最小镜像距离，非周期分子即使没有晶胞也可以只做此项检查。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:50
#: 5db7a1a4fbea40258bad748a7330f893
msgid ""
"阈值应低于候选池中所有合理键长。不要把金属体系常用的 1.0~1.5 Å 直接用于含 H–"
"H、O–H 或其他短键的混合数据集；这张卡不会根据共价半径自动调整阈值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:52
#: 6dc77ef720de417da7797e09b68a2214
msgid "最小单原子体积（min_volume_per_atom）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:54
#: f89a74ccdf22435c8395740bee63da89
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。允许的最小单原子体积，过滤过度压缩的结构。阈值应来"
"自同材料平衡体积的下界。多孔、slab 或含真空的体系不要随便打开，开了反而误删合"
"理结构。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0` (disabled). Minimum volume per atom for rejecting "
"overcompressed cells. Derive it from the material's volume range. Avoid it "
"for porous, slab, or vacuum-containing systems where it can reject valid "
"structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:56
#: 3ea306dfc4a54ae5a3ea54018e8ce00f
msgid "最大单原子体积（max_volume_per_atom）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:58
#: 91648486a1f5499cad1d2cfd7b270b4a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。允许的最大单原子体积，过滤过度拉伸或异常大 cell。"
"体相候选池可以设一个合理上界；slab/分子体系有真空时这个阈值容易误杀。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0` (disabled). Maximum volume per atom for rejecting "
"expanded or abnormal cells. A bulk pool may use a justified bound; slabs and "
"molecular cells with vacuum generally should not."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:60
#: df5f5d8222b9461b88940f25deda35e8
msgid "最小密度（min_density）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:62
#: 1c0b56a6e8b24596b5fa895709a43a36
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。按质量密度过滤低密度异常结构。只在体相或近体相候选"
"池打开；含真空、孔洞或表面模型应保持 0。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0` (disabled). Minimum mass density. Enable only for "
"bulk-like pools; keep zero for vacuum, pores, or surfaces."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:64
#: 2f07582729ea496c9b7ad2f17acb8f44
msgid "最大密度（max_density）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:66
#: a848a63a5dc1460083ae1eb8acc23887
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。按质量密度过滤过度压缩的结构。阈值应参考该材料的真"
"实密度上界，不要跨元素体系套同一个数字。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0` (disabled). Maximum mass density for rejecting "
"overcompressed structures. Use a material-specific physical upper bound, not "
"one value across chemical systems."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:68
#: 568ed4f8bdb9464e8da4105e3b7b75a4
msgid "要求有限且非零体积的晶胞（require_finite_cell）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:70
#: 602cf94478a0411c9bc13bb04b45fca1
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后，含 NaN/Inf 或行列式接近零的晶胞会被删除。任何体积"
"或密度上下限只要开启，也会隐式要求有效的非零体积晶胞。晶体、slab、界面候选池"
"建议开；孤立分子或非周期构型关掉。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:72
#: 055a0f5c4e48442682e37ace49f97a33
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:74
#: aafd688fc8b94d83b500cd0016763edd
msgid "短键门槛"
msgstr "Short-distance gate"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:76
#: b10500f33f554a2c977ccd4f8ad69ca9
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"GeometryFilterCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"min_pair_distance\": 1.2,\n"
"    \"min_volume_per_atom\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"max_volume_per_atom\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"min_density\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"max_density\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"require_finite_cell\": false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:90
#: 3336cda3f9724925b9de59024f87f311
msgid "用于随机扰动、插入缺陷或随机占位后的第一道硬检查。"
msgstr ""
"First hard check after random perturbation, defect insertion, or random "
"occupation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:92
#: 0a41ff2e39f34dbd9fa30e327fbab764
msgid "晶体候选池清洗"
msgstr "Crystal candidate-pool cleaning"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:94
#: 2f5848e3880c443c8ca42581f1c9f718
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"GeometryFilterCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"min_pair_distance\": 1.1,\n"
"    \"min_volume_per_atom\": 5.0,\n"
"    \"max_volume_per_atom\": 60.0,\n"
"    \"min_density\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"max_density\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"require_finite_cell\": true\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:108
#: 8db547f7b6a04fcba44f9d626ec9e095
msgid "用于晶体、缺陷和表面候选池，防止零体积或极端体积结构进入后续流程。"
msgstr ""
"Prevent zero-volume or extreme-volume crystal, defect, and surface "
"structures from entering later stages."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:110
#: d8c7b8b66d0b4903a183f0353c7e4cda
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:112
#: 1cc26f5269ef482a8ec5b163656e01c4
msgid ""
"`Atomic Perturb → Geometry Filter → FPS Filter`：先生成位移扰动，再删除短键，"
"最后做代表性采样。"
msgstr ""
"`Atomic Perturb` -> `Geometry Filter` -> `FPS Filter`: add displacement "
"diversity, reject short bonds, then sample representatives."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:113
#: ce5d2f9b64e145b28fcb1c70191cb495
msgid ""
"`Random Occupancy → Geometry Filter → FPS Filter`：合金占位后先做几何门槛，再"
"选代表结构去 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Occupancy` -> `Geometry Filter` -> `FPS Filter`: gate alloy "
"occupations geometrically before selecting DFT candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:114
#: d6b0478172c54a2782c62c95f17ae3d4
msgid ""
"`Random Slab → Insert Defect → Geometry Filter`：表面插入后检查吸附物和基底是"
"否重叠。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Slab` -> `Insert Defect` -> `Geometry Filter`: detect adsorbate-"
"substrate overlaps after surface insertion."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:116
#: 36e84ce336ef444e84e422a935c18bc8
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:118
#: 186fd7bb3c154b82a07484de789273ca
msgid ""
"**输出为空。** 至少一个阈值过严。先看最短键和体积分布，确认阈值是否超出了当前"
"体系的真实范围。"
msgstr ""
"**No output.** At least one threshold is too strict. Inspect pair-distance "
"and volume distributions and compare the limits with the actual system."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:120
#: 6d93990511834f01ade2db1052ed47b7
msgid ""
"**密度阈值不生效。** `min_density=0.0` 和 `max_density=0.0` 都表示关闭密度检"
"查。只有大于 0 的阈值参与判定。"
msgstr ""
"**Density limits have no effect.** Zero disables `min_density` and "
"`max_density`; only positive limits participate."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:122
#: 99c56ee5c22f430ca2d99feb3e1dac2f
msgid ""
"**非周期分子被删掉。** 如果开启了体积、密度或 `要求有限且非零体积的晶胞`"
"（`require_finite_cell`），零体积分子会被删除。分子构象清洗通常只开 `允许的最"
"短原子对距离`（`min_pair_distance`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:124
#: 8f2ca2819a0241548e28f1bd44560718
msgid ""
"**为什么不能给混合化学体系设置一个可靠的通用短键阈值？** 当前参数是统一的绝对"
"距离，不读取元素对或键级。先查看数据中各元素对的合理距离范围；如果无法给出统"
"一下界，应把阈值保持为 0，并在更合适的元素对检查工具中处理。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:126
#: 7a1b9b161fcc489caaeff0bb80741b15
msgid ""
"**多个条件同时失败时预览怎么计数？** 预览按空结构、非有限坐标、无效晶胞、短距"
"离、单原子体积、密度的顺序记录第一个失败原因，因此各原因计数之和等于删除总"
"数，不代表后续条件一定通过。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:128
#: b9ac0de12dae4fd3bb8adec3c55f444e
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:130
#: e841a1fc25814fe58884f05492be4c51
msgid "本卡是过滤卡，不修改保留下来的 `Config_type`。"
msgstr "This filter preserves `Config_type` on retained structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:132
#: 95cb1cd6274b46b9943c65b5590339ec
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:134
#: b0778f38f39e47edb72e89d9e3cc1db3
msgid "本卡没有随机性。同一输入和同一阈值会得到相同输出。"
msgstr ""
"The card is deterministic: identical inputs and thresholds produce identical "
"outputs."

#~ msgid "几何过滤（Geometry Filter）"
#~ msgstr "Geometry Filter"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Geometry Filter` 按显式阈值过滤候选结构：最短原子间距、单原子体积、质量密"
#~ "度和有限晶胞。它不计算能量，不修复结构，也不替代 `FPS Filter`。它的职责是"
#~ "在代表性采样和 DFT 前挡掉几何上已经明显不可用的结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Geometry Filter` rejects candidates using explicit thresholds for "
#~ "minimum pair distance, volume per atom, mass density, and finite cell "
#~ "volume. It computes no energy, repairs nothing, and does not replace `FPS "
#~ "Filter`. Use it before representative sampling and DFT to remove geometry "
#~ "that is already clearly unusable."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 已生成的候选结构池。 **目标：** 在 FPS 前删除短键和异常体积结"
#~ "构。 **参数设置：** `min_pair_distance=1.2`，`min_volume_per_atom=5.0`，"
#~ "`max_volume_per_atom=40.0`，密度阈值保持关闭。 **输出：** 只保留满足所有开"
